# UI dropdowns

- Use the same dropdown styling and interaction behavior for every UI selector.
- In `agent/index.html`, reuse `.selector-picker`, `.selector-menu`,
  `.selector-option`, `pickerOption()` and `updatePicker()` as Model, Thinking
  and Fault scenario do. Keep sizing responsive to the option labels.
- Preserve selection checkmarks, Escape/outside-click dismissal, focus handling
  and disabled states during loading or a running turn.
- Keep each selector's existing action: choosing a fault automatically loads it;
  rendering or refreshing its current value must not inject a fault.
